  "technical_internal_limitation": "The strict witness inequality is not yet certified. An independent implementation reproduced the displayed covariance eigenvalue band and, in \\(2{,}000{,}000\\) Gaussian draws with seed \\(59212\\), estimated probability \\(0.4867\\) for the conservative rejection subset at \\(\\alpha=0.4\\). This Monte Carlo diagnostic is not a proof. The open question requires a deterministic or rigorously error-bounded sum of Gaussian polyhedral probabilities. Finite multiplier simulation error is also outside the exact-conditional-quantile theorem.",
